{
  "about": [
    "Every committed render baseline and the exact invocation that reproduces it.",
    "Until this file existed the mapping lived only in prose (milestone-verification-scenes.md,",
    "showcase-tour.md, CLAUDE.md) and in hardcoded Rust in crates/engine-cli/tests/cli.rs, so",
    "'re-diff everything' and 'the A/B check between two binaries' were reassembled by hand every",
    "time. Now they are a loop over this list: bin/verify-baselines.",
    "",
    "Paths are repo-relative. 'args' are the flags that select WHAT is rendered (--steps, --time,",
    "--input); size is not among them because diff-render always renders at the baseline's own",
    "dimensions -- width/height are here for the bless path, which is `engine screenshot`.",
    "",
    "Baselines are per-adapter AND per-build-profile artifacts: bless from the debug binary, which",
    "is what `cargo test` runs and what bin/engine builds by default (CLAUDE.md, M19).",
    "",
    "repo_contracts.rs::every_committed_baseline_is_listed_in_the_manifest keeps this file honest:",
    "a new baseline that is not listed here fails the build.",
    "",
    "'pinned_by' is 'cli.rs' when a CLI test diff-renders the artifact and fails the build on drift,",
    "and 'hand' when nothing automated checks it -- 15 of the 26 baselines are in the second group,",
    "which is why the sweep exists. The first run of it found m14_break.png one channel step off in",
    "one pixel: the pre-existing drift CLAUDE.md records under M17, still uncorrected, invisible",
    "until now because no test looks at that PNG."
  ],
